          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The analog of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartesian+space"} Cartesian space
            in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergeometry"} supergeometry
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supermanifold"} supermanifold
            with a single canonical
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coordinate+chart"} coordinate chart
          %p
            For suitable even|odd dimension this is naturally equipped with the structure of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergroup"} supergroup
            that makes it a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super-translation+group"} super-translation group
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super-Minkowski+spacetime"} super-Minkowski spacetime
